  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/swo/SWO_0000399">
    <rdfs:comment>There is one EDAM html class (EDAM_format:2331) and one SWO class (SWO_0000399) within swo_data.owl. EDAM_format:2331 was retained and SWO_0000399 deemed obsolete, as EDAM_format:2331 has a better location in the hierarchy and is an imported term. All axioms belonging to SWO_0000399 were transferred to EDAM_format:2331. Please use EDAM_format:2331 (in this ontology via its full URI http://edamontology.org/format_2331) instead.</rdfs:comment>
