  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/swo/SWO_0000434">
    <ns1:obsoleted_in_version>0.4</ns1:obsoleted_in_version>
    <rdfs:comment>SWO_0000434 was initially created within the originalsoftwareontology.owl and later moved to swo_data.owl. SWO_3000016, with the label 'TIFF', is also present, and stored within swo_data.owl. SWO_3000016 was retained and SWO_0000434 deemed obsolete, as SWO_3000016 has a better location in the hierarchy. All axioms belonging to SWO_0000434 were transferred to SWO_3000016. Please use SWO_3000016 instead.</rdfs:comment>
