    <rdfs:label>obsolete_FCS</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Obsoleted as it was a generic term where there was no way of knowing for sure which format it was - or which version the format was in. Perhaps could have been annotated and moved, but this class was only identified after a new class (http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/data/SWO_3000061) had been created. Please use the new class (SWO_3000061) or its versioned children instead of this obsolete class.</rdfs:comment>
